    "detailed_description": "Immerse yourself in a boundless adventure at the heart of <strong>Etera</strong> extraordinary journey through an imaginary world.<br><br>You have to overcome many obstacles in this side scroller adventure, while finding  yourself in scenarios rich in detail and complexity, where the thin line between reality and fantasy dissolves.<br><br>Measure your skill in <strong>timing</strong>, <strong>coordination</strong>, and <strong>strategy</strong> as you carefully plan each move to reach the end of your journey. <br><br>Each level will be unique, with intricate tracks that require agility and quick reflexes. <br>You'll be constantly challenged by new obstacles and traps that will try to stop you on your way to the end.<br><br>Navigate through environments so realistic they seem tangible, yet surreal enough to capture your imagination with a unique blend of familiar and unexpected elements.<br><br>Every moment will mark the pace of your quest, influencing the plot and direction of your journey. <br>Face challenges in a mutable timeline, where the past and the future intertwine.<br><br>Indulge in the luxury of experiencing the magic of never-before-seen worlds, where climatic adversities become either a precious ally or a insidious adversary.<br><br><strong>Climb</strong>, <strong>run</strong>, and reach the highest peaks. Take on the challenge and discover what is your purpose inside <strong>Etera</strong>!",
